# Revoked-key pin list for scripts/secretscan: one sha256 hex per line.
# Hashes only — never put plaintext keys here. Each line must be the
# hash of the WHOLE key: matching runs against key-shaped candidates
# only (whole candidate / embedded sk- token / alphanumeric run >=16
# chars). Short fragments are never hashed — a short-fragment hash
# could be brute-forced back to the key.
